			"hadithnumber": 2280,
			"arabicnumber": 2280,
			"text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:\"When the Prophet (ﷺ) came (to Al-Madinah), they used to pay in advance for dates, two or three years in advance. He said: 'Whoever pays in advance for dates, let him pay for a known amount or a known weight, to be delivered at a known time.’”",
